        "created_at": "2016-06-28T13:54:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>May be my mistake, I thought he was referred to as World's Greatest Legacy, will have to go doublecheck that.</p><p><span>Update: upon checking, looks like it should be AGL and not WGL. I think I originally saw that mis-atribution on steam forums:&nbsp;</span><span>https://steamcommunity.com/app/337150/discussions/0/617335934142262432/</span></p><p><span>AGL it is!</span></p><p>Of course, I've been considering swapping back from Scholar to AA so AA can help pump Unity for bots off-turn, so now that would be: TLT/AGL/Unity/DV/AA - or TAUDA? ;p</p>",
